/-- **Lemma [lem:spectral-unitary]** Positivity and the unitary extension.  `𝒢_μ` is an
isometry from `(𝒟, ⟨·,·⟩_𝓔)` into `𝒦`: the `L²(ν)` inner product of `U f` and `U g` (which in
