    ∫ s in Set.Ioi (0 : ℝ), Real.exp (-s * ⟪P z, z⟫) * s ^ (α / 2 - 1) =
      Real.Gamma (α / 2) * ⟪P z, z⟫ ^ (-(α / 2)) := by
```

