`OperatorRidgelet.Paper.lem_mixture_character_iv`, theorem in [`Challenge/Transform.lean`](https://github.com/shosonoda/lean-operator-ridgelet/blob/main/OperatorRidgelet/Challenge/Transform.lean#L410):

